{
  "label": "Header Field",
  "category": "interface-xlsx",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Konfigurasi Header Field",
      "id": "details-header-field",
      "intro": "Sub-tab Header Field pada laci pemetaan XLSX memungkinkan pengguna mendefinisikan dan mengatur field-field pada bagian header pesan transaksi XLSX. Setiap field header mendeskripsikan metadata utama yang diperlukan untuk mengidentifikasi dan memproses file Excel yang masuk.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Daftar & Detail Header Field",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Tabel header field menampilkan seluruh field header yang terdaftar untuk message type yang dipilih.\n• Informasi yang ditampilkan:\n  - **Field Name:** Nama identifikasi field header.\n  - **Description:** Deskripsi fungsi field.\n  - **Length:** Panjang data maksimum yang diizinkan.\n  - **Sequence:** Urutan posisi field dalam header.\n  - **Data Type:** Tipe data field (STRING, NUMERIC, dll). Tipe ARRAY_OBJ, ARRAY_STRING, dan OBJECT tidak tersedia untuk header.\n  - **DER (Data Element Requirement):** Status mandatory field — MANDATORY, OPTIONAL, atau CONDITIONAL.\n• Panel outside (sisi kiri, 310px) menampilkan detail field terpilih secara kontekstual.",
          "color": "#107c41",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.08);border:1px solid #bbf7d0;background:#fff;width:300px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#f0fdf4;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Header Field</span><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#107c41;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">+ Add</span></div><div style=\"padding:0;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:9px;\"><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc;\"><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">Field</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">Type</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">Len</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">DER</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\">file_id</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;\"><span style=\"padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(16,124,65,.1);font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#107c41;\">STRING</span></td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;color:#64748b;\">36</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;\"><span style=\"padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(239,68,68,.1);font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">M</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\">timestamp</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;\"><span style=\"padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(16,124,65,.1);font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#107c41;\">STRING</span></td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;color:#64748b;\">20</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;\"><span style=\"padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(239,68,68,.1);font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">M</span></td></tr></table></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Form Tambah / Edit Header Field",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\nDrawer form berukuran **480px** menyediakan field berikut:\n1. **Field Name** *(Wajib)*: Nama identifikasi field header.\n2. **Description** *(Wajib)*: Deskripsi fungsi dan kegunaan field (textarea 2-4 baris).\n3. **Length** *(Wajib)*: Panjang data maksimum field (angka positif).\n4. **Sequence** *(Wajib)*: Urutan posisi field dalam header (angka positif).\n5. **Data Type** *(Wajib)*: Pilih tipe data — STRING, NUMERIC, DATE, BOOLEAN, dll. Tipe objek/array tidak tersedia untuk header.\n6. **DER** *(Wajib)*: Data Element Requirement — pilih MANDATORY, OPTIONAL, atau CONDITIONAL.",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border:1px solid #bbf7d0;background:#fff;width:280px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #bbf7d0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0fdf4,#dcfce7);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:#107c41;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8z\"/><polyline points=\"14 2 14 8 20 8\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Create Header Field</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Fill in the header field details</div></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;font-size:9.5px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Field Name <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">Enter field name</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Description <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;min-height:30px;\">Enter description</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Length <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">0</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Sequence <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">0</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Data Type <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">Choose</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">DER <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">Choose</div></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 14px;border-top:1px solid #bbf7d0;display:flex;gap:6px;\"><button style=\"flex:1;padding:5px;border-radius:5px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#475569;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;\">Cancel</button><button style=\"flex:1;padding:5px;border-radius:5px;background:#107c41;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;\">Create</button></div></div>"
          }
        }
